# script.js — Core Frontend JavaScript
# File: data/script.js

## PURPOSE
Shared JS loaded by all pages. Handles navigation, status polling, health monitoring, license checks.

## NAVIGATION
- nav(url): Navigate with auto-save of form state on setup pages
- _saveFormState(): Save input/select values to sessionStorage (prefix: _fs_<gamename>_)
- _restoreFormState(): Restore saved form values on page load
- _isSetupPage(): Check if URL contains "_setup"

## STATUS LOOP
- startStatusLoop(): 1s interval polling /api/status
- updateStatus(): Fetch puck array, update UI
- updateHeader(pucks): Signal strength indicators (green/yellow/red bars)
- updateSettingsTable(pucks): HTML table of connected pucks (battery, RSSI, version, temp)

## CACHE BUSTING
- _fwVer: Fetched from /api/version, appended as ?v= to all link hrefs

## HEALTH MONITORING
- checkBatteryLevels(pucks): Toast warnings for low battery (critical/warn thresholds)
- checkTemperature(pucks): Alert at 60°C (600 in 0.1°C units), hysteresis at 55°C
- _playTempAlarm(): 3 beeps at 1000Hz via Web Audio API
- RAM watchdog: 10s interval, toast if heap < 20KB
- LittleFS check: Warning if free space < 15% (runs once on index/musical_setup)

## QUIET MODE
- toggleQuietMode(on): /api/quiet_mode?val=0|1
- _showQuietBadge(): Shows 🔇 indicator when active

## HAPTIC FEEDBACK
- haptic(ms): navigator.vibrate(), default 20ms
- Auto-triggered on button clicks

## LICENSE CHECK
- checkLicenseAndNavigate(url): Fetches /api/license
  - If status !== 'FULL' AND playtime_hours*60 >= playtime_limit_minutes
  - Shows confirm dialog, redirects to /register.html if confirmed

## SYSTEM PREFERENCES
- _getSysPrefs(): Load from localStorage.sys_prefs (JSON object)
- Used for battery thresholds, heap warnings, etc.
